# CDAC AI Report Generator

Version: 1.0

---

# Vision

An AI-powered Vulnerability Assessment & Penetration Testing (VAPT) reporting platform that enables security auditors to efficiently manage projects, document findings, upload evidence, leverage AI for report content generation, and produce organization-specific professional reports.

The system should reduce repetitive manual documentation while preserving auditor control over every report.

---

# Primary Users

## Administrator

Responsible for system management.

Can

- Manage Users
- Manage Projects
- Manage Master Vulnerability Library
- Generate Reports
- Configure Organization Templates
- Review Findings

---

## Auditor

Responsible for security assessments.

Can

- Create Projects
- Create Findings
- Create Custom Findings
- Upload Evidence
- Edit Finding Content
- Generate AI Content
- Generate Reports

Cannot

- Edit Master Vulnerability Library
- Manage Users

