# Business Rules

Administrators manage the Master Vulnerability Library.

Auditors cannot edit Master Vulnerabilities.

Selecting a Master Vulnerability copies all content into the Finding.

After copying, the Finding becomes completely independent.

Editing a Finding never changes the Master Vulnerability.

A Custom Finding has no Master Vulnerability.

Each Finding contains multiple Evidence records.

Each Evidence contains one Screenshot and one Step Description.

Reports are generated using Finding data, not Master Vulnerability data.

Historical reports never change.

AI generates content only for Findings and Evidence.
